#: includes/settings.php:702
msgid "If you have a review code and leave a note on this site with Finishcoat, we store the name you type, your message, the page and the spot on the page it is about, the label of your review code, and any photos you send. Display copies of photos have location and camera data removed. The original files are kept so the site owner can download them. Your IP address is used only as a one-way hash to limit how many notes can be sent in an hour, and is not stored with your note."
